"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:27px"><br>
<span style=3D"word-break: break-word; font-size: 18px;">It has been a bad =
week for Ukraine. What began with President Trump pausing diesel sanctions =
on Russia has ended with the US leader outrageously labelling President Zel=
ensky a =E2=80=9Cdisgrace=E2=80=9D. The prospects for peace seem remote. Bu=
t, perhaps more in hope than expectation, Britain is getting ready to help =
in the event of a ceasefire. As&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://link.thetimes.com/c=
lick/47970560.376114/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhldGltZXMuY29tL3VrL3BvbGl0aWNzL2FydG=
ljbGUvc3RyZWV0aW5nLTAwbGJxOTkwNQ/6a464fcf7d55e1fcfb02eb9cB16277ff6" target=
=3D"_blank" style=3D"text-decoration: underline; color: #006699;" rel=3D"no=
opener">Larisa Brown reveals today</a>, the UK is sending hundreds of troop=
s to Poland to rehearse deploying in Ukraine after an end to the war. The g=
oal is to make sure we are prepared to help keep the peace should one come =
to pass. It=E2=80=99s a welcome gesture of support for Ukraine after a toug=
h few days.</span>
</p><p style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:27px"><br>
<span style=3D"word-break: break-word; font-size: 18px;">Barrelling like a =
Spitfire as it glided briefly through the Texas night, Elon Musk=E2=80=99s =
latest Tesla marked the arrival of a new era in automobility. To describe t=
he tech billionaire=E2=80=99s innovation as a flying car might be a touch s=
trong, but the next-generation =E2=80=9CRoadster=E2=80=9D is an undeniably =
impressive piece of kit. Laurence Sleator, our transport correspondent, get=
s under the bonnet of how it works in this&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://link.the=
times.com/click/47970560.376114/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhldGltZXMuY29tL3VrL3RyYW5=
