l=3D"noopener">we look at all the traps</a> and perverse incentives, such a=
s the one Raqual faces. We have also&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://link.thetimes.=
com/click/47970560.376114/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhldGltZXMuY29tL3VrL3dlbGZhcmUta=
