noopener">made a visit to Germany</a>, where the country=E2=80=99s no-excus=
es approach and network of rehab clinics mean far fewer people get signed o=
ff work for good.</span>
</p><p style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:27px"><br>
<span style=3D"word-break: break-word; font-size: 18px;">Coral Golding&nbsp=
